WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
Let you take action

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:04,160
You brought it on yourself, okay, Dashan, leave them alone.

3
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,620
That was the security captain just now

4
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:20,020
Now I have to look for a job again. What are I looking for?

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,140
I came here today just to change your job

6
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:25,220
The business of my convenience store has been booming recently and I can’t handle it alone.

7
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,180
You will go to work at my place starting tomorrow

8
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:32,290
I can't pay you two hundred a day with three meals a day. Brother, I can't take advantage of you.

9
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:33,490
Just give me three thousand

10
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,740
Okay, that's it.

11
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:42,360
I don't need these two hundred yuan right now. I can rent a room for you.
